{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_indigo_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_indigo_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "硬核饮品",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_indigo_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bea2f4314585218942b92d449ac5456430c2361363e4ae3d5b7301a74163b5fb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嚓咔嚓......\n咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "真羡慕深靛小姐啊，头发这么长，发质又很好，不管怎么打理都好看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "有吗？我其实不这么觉得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "为什么这么说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "之前在海边的时候，空气太潮湿，我的头发总是湿答答的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "头请往左稍微偏一点——好啦，保持这个姿势不要动哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嚓咔嚓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "......来到罗德岛之后，头发倒是不会湿了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "可这几天，空气突然变得干燥了，打理头发也变得麻烦起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "应该是罗德岛行驶到某些干旱区域了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嚓咔嚓......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "是这样吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "嗯......应该是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "就因为空气太干燥，我的头发都开始起静电了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咔嚓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "连深靛小姐这么漂亮的头发都开始起静电了？很严重吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "让我想想......大概是早上梳头的时候头发就像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "就像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "让我想个比较像的东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "就像D32钢一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "有的时候，短一点的头发还会像RMA70-12那样直立起来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我的头发又起静电了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "呃，不，这倒不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "——但是我从来都不知道，原来深靛小姐头发的静电问题这么严重！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "静电对发质的损伤是很大的，我自己在这上面吃过好多亏！这种问题可不能视而不见，一定要好好处理！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "唔......真的有这么可怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "短时间倒不会有太大问题，但一直这么下去，头发会变得更干燥，断发和掉发的问题也会变严重的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "而且深靛小姐，你是伊比利亚人，你还说自己以前住在海边，头发总是湿答答的，对吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "那就更不能不管啦。你的头发已经适应了潮湿环境，突然来到干燥地区，受到的伤害会比其他人更大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我推荐深靛小姐试试这款后勤部开发的抗静电发膜，保湿的效果很好，也适合深靛小姐偏干的发质。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "唔......好香。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "这个要多少钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "不要钱的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "这是试用装，你先拿回去用，如果觉得效果还不错，就去后勤部申请，他们会给你免费发正式装的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "蓝毒，还有格劳克斯？你们好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "你们好，小深靛，还有澄闪小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "啊，蓝毒小姐......还有格劳克斯小姐，你们好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "考虑到小深靛理发可能还要花点时间，我们来给你送点吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "谢谢你们啦。正好我头发刚刚剪好，吃点东西再做养护。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "澄闪要来吃一点吗？蓝毒做的点心很好吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我......我是很想尝尝蓝毒小姐的手艺，可这个，这个湖蓝色的蛋糕坯，到底是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "不要紧，制作过程一点都不复杂，染色只用了一种东西哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "一种？可这种湖蓝色......真的有什么食物能给面团染上这种颜色吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "大概是某种不太常见的素材，不能一次性吃太多的那种。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸——欸？！难道是，难道是——不对，不是这个颜色的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "难道是我闻所未闻的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉，玩笑开得稍大了一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "不是澄闪你想象中那些恐怖的东西，很平常的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "可用来给面团染色的，到底是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "是食用色素哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "——色素？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "当然啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "蓝毒对甜品的颜色很有讲究，如果一般的材料没法实现她的想法，就只能依靠食用色素啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我还在想，有什么果实能给面团染上这种颜色......结果只能想到一些有毒的东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "那，蓝毒小姐，我尝一块这个蛋糕，可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我不客气啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "（咀嚼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "（两眼放光）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我能再吃一块吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "当然了，没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "这里还有饮料。对，玫红色的这个，搭配甜品很不错的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸？发生什么了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "看起来是停电了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "我出去看看情况，检查一下线路。你们先不要动，我马上回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "怎么会突然停电了呢？难道是我又没能控制好静电？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我觉得不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "你刚刚给我理发的时候，我一次都没被电到过，所以应该不是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "啊......其实还是电到过一次的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "有吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "说到静电，会不会是因为屋里的某个电器短路了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "也说不定——对了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "来电了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "是小深靛的源石技艺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "确实和平时的灯光不太一样，感觉色调很不一样，好温暖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "不过，这样对深靛小姐来说负担不会太大吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "没问题的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "如果因为施术觉得体力不支，随时可以来我这里补充糖分和水分哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我以前可是灯塔看守人，就算没有设备，这点光照也不过是小菜一碟，不用担心我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我帮你们照明，你们看看房间里有没有出故障的电器吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "那就麻烦深靛小姐了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "让我看看，吹风机、推子、加热器......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "这边是热水器、电视机......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "蓝毒，我喝点饮料可以吗，有点口渴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "喝吧，记得喝玫红色的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "那我不客气啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "烫发机......没有更多电器了，这边一切正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "我这边也看不出什么异常，可能还是外部原因。等小格劳回来再说吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "小深靛，不用再施术了，来休息一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "小深靛？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我还是比较习惯有一点光亮的环境。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "光亮能给人希望，老师是这么告诉我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "以前看守灯塔的时候，我和老师也会尽量让灯火亮的时间长一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "只要你别太累就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "都说了是小菜一碟啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "说起停电......以前我在维多利亚上学的时候，也有过在晚上遭遇停电的经历。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "一定很不方便吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "对一心学习的同学来说确实是这样啦，所以他们会点起蜡烛读书。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "不过对大多数同学来说，停电了就跟放假没什么两样，大家会开始闲聊什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "坐在烛光里和同学聊天，分享偷偷带进教室的零食......现在的感觉和那时有点像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "那......需要我把光灭掉吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "那倒不必啦，如果没有蜡烛，教室里一片漆黑，大家也高兴不起来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "说得对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "我去问过了，只是短时间的供电不稳，马上就好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "——好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "我们也不在这儿多打扰了，点心就留给你们。我们先回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "感谢二位！任何时候，如果需要理发，都请到我这里来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "我替小格劳答应你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "我自己还是算了。虽然几率很低，但和我发生身体接触还是有一定的危险性，我不得不注意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "原来是这样啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "那我们先走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "好的！等饮料喝完，我把杯子洗好，给你们送过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "多谢，送到我宿舍就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我之前只知道蓝毒小姐是用毒高手，从来不知道她这么和善。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "嗯，蓝毒一直很和善的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "不过，一开始的时候，她不知道我是敌是友，一度把弩箭架在我脖子上来着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "其实也没什么，问清楚之后她就把弩箭拿开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "而且她随口问了个问题就判断出我是伊比利亚人，还给我解释了我和别人之间发生的误会，说那些人把我当成了赏金猎人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "（听起来有点怪怪的......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我吃好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "嗯，我也差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "我们接着进行下一步吧，我帮你涂养护液——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "深靛小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "澄、澄闪，我问你一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "好的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "刚刚蓝毒让你喝的饮料，是、是什么颜色的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "让我想想......她说的是“玫红色”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸，你的饮料是淡紫色的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "淡紫色的是什么口味，我能尝尝吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "别，别碰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "那个是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "（不行，不行，不能跟她解释那个饮料的事。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "（她好不容易才建立起对蓝毒的好印象。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "那个是......格劳克斯的饮料。刚刚光照不够，我看错颜色了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "所以你和她拿错饮料了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "没错，就是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "你看起来晕乎乎的——难道格劳克斯小姐的饮料是含酒精的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "那倒不是......不过也差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "你脸色看起来不太好。要休息一会儿吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "嗯，好的，我去休息一会儿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "正好，我趁这个机会收拾一下托盘和杯子——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "不、不、不行，不要碰格劳克斯的饮料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸？为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "（这......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我、我去刷杯子吧。我自己的......饮料杯，我自己、自己刷......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "可你看起来真的不太舒服......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "不用勉强自己的，我去刷杯子就好，你好好休息一会儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "等等，等等！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "欸，深靛小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "......把半杯饮料都喝掉了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我......失陪一下，我去一趟医疗、医疗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "医疗部？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "没错，我去、一趟、医疗部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "这个杯子你先不要、不要、不要碰，等我......回来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "你看起来真的很不舒服，我陪你一起去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "不、用，我没事......你在这里......等我......我一会儿回来还要、还要护理那个那个那个、头发......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "深靛站起身来，像喝得酩酊大醉一样，东倒西歪地走出了房间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "深靛小姐到底是怎么了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "难道她是对格劳克斯小姐饮料里面的东西过敏？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "不行，我得去看看她——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "澄闪小姐？小深靛呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "蓝毒小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "她刚刚说要去医疗部，摇摇晃晃地出去了。我很担心她，她是不是出什么事了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "你是说她一个人摇摇晃晃地走出去了？她没昏过去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "没有......虽然我确实有点担心她会不会倒在半路上，她看起来像是喝醉了一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "（安心的叹气声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "她喝剩的饮料呢？我来把饮料处理掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "是说淡紫色那个吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格劳克斯",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "她喝了半杯，看起来就不太舒服。我想去把饮料倒掉，把杯子刷干净，她却说什么也不让我去，最后直接把饮料喝干了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒&格劳克斯",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "她喝了一整杯，然后还摇摇晃晃地自己走出了这个房间？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澄闪",
      "text": "是这样没错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "该说她什么好呢......成长迅速吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "（苦笑）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "那杯饮料里的东西也不是特别烈性的那种，她只要出得了这个门就到得了医疗部，到了医疗部就不用担心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蓝毒",
      "text": "格劳克斯，保险起见，你还是去医疗部看看深靛——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "请问蓝毒干员和格劳克斯干员在吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "感觉好些了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "好多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "蓝毒的解毒剂起效真快啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "当然，你被毒倒了这么多次，对毒药的抗性也越来越强了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "说起来，蓝毒一向很有分寸的，这次你摄入的毒素的量却比平常多好多。怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "因为我搞错了，把格劳克斯的饮料喝了下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "格劳克斯干员？我记得她几乎可以说是百毒不侵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "是的，所以蓝毒给她调制的饮料里面，会放一些对常人来说有毒的东西。但对格劳克斯来说，那不过是口味新奇的提神佐料罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "就好像咖啡对一些动物有毒那样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "如果喝掉饮料的不是我，而是其他干员，症状还要强烈很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "一般人也不会去喝格劳克斯干员的饮料的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "还要水吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "嗯......我隐约记得，来医疗部的路上，我遇到了什么人，那个人把我送了过来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "是艾丽妮干员。她把你送了过来，然后就走掉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "艾丽妮，艾丽妮......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "——审判官？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "没错，就是那位年纪很轻的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我出去一趟！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "text": "你刚刚恢复过来，不适合剧烈运动——你到底要去哪里呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "呼、呼、呼......还是有点晕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "不行，我得赶快——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "艾丽妮小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "你恢复得很快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "确实，我对毒物的抗性稍高一些——不对，我不是要说这个！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "艾丽妮小姐，请千万不要怪罪蓝毒和格劳克斯她们，她们不是故意的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "（叹气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "是我自己误喝了格劳克斯的饮料，责任全都在我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "（更重地叹气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "深靛干员，我推荐你回到医疗部再休息一会儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "为......为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "因为你的神志好像还是不太清醒。你显然把我的形象和某些被人歪曲的审判官形象重合在一起了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "......啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "她们刚刚把事情都告诉我了。你喝了格劳克斯干员的饮料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "由于格劳克斯干员对毒剂的抗性，那个饮料对她来说有提神作用，但对其他人来说只是碰一碰都会中毒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "还有那位一直噼里啪啦响个不停的小理发师在一旁做证，我可以确信，这确实只是一起不幸的小事故。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "所以......所以她们安然无恙，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "你啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "我现在是罗德岛的一名干员。就算她们真的故意下毒害你，我也不可能自作主张，当场对她们做什么出格的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "对于既是罗德岛干员又是伊比利亚人的你来说，这总该想得到吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "对、对不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "没关系，你能明白就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "好啦，你刚刚中了毒，赶紧去休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "还有什么事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "艾丽妮小姐的嘴角......有湖蓝色的蛋糕碎屑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "这个......调查事件的真相也是工作的一环，就算这意味着以身犯险......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "呃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "（小声）......至少在尝第一块的时候，我是这么想的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "（小声）当然，那位小理发师拼尽全力，差一点就声泪俱下的推荐也很重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "原来是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "这么说你可能会不高兴，但你和我以前见过的其他审判官......确实不太一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我所知的伊比利亚审判官，就算知道某个阿戈尔人清白无辜，也决不会和那个人多发生一丁点接触。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "我承认，在这一点上我稍微特殊一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "不过，如果真的有邪恶藏身于此，我也决不会手下留情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "你呢，深靛干员？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "不论是作为罗德岛干员也好，还是作为伊比利亚人也好，我想听听你对这些事的看法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "我没想那么多。我只知道蓝毒和格劳克斯是我的朋友，我不想让朋友因为我蒙受冤屈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "我喜欢你的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "text": "再见，深靛干员，和你聊天很愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "再见，艾丽妮小姐——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "等等，这股香味......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深靛",
      "text": "澄闪也给你推荐了同一款发膜吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
